1
00:00:07,230 --> 00:00:10,190
Shigeo, wait! Remain calm!

2
00:00:10,190 --> 00:00:12,150
Look into my eyes!

3
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:17,400
I can tell these aren't real bodies!

4
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:19,080
They're dummies!

5
00:00:19,390 --> 00:00:22,290
Some esper probably
put them here to fool you!

6
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:24,860
Come on, Dimple.

7
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:27,100
Does a psychic power like that really exist?

8
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:30,880
J-Just think about everything you've seen!
It's completely possible!

9
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:32,880
No, I know it's out there!

10
00:00:40,370 --> 00:00:41,310
I found them.

11
00:00:41,310 --> 00:00:43,600
Did he just learn how to do that?

12
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:45,560
That's gotta be our guy!

13
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:46,810
Dimple...

14
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:51,280
Thank you for stopping me.

15
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:55,490
We can't relax just yet.
We're going after them, aren't we?

16
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:59,450
Of course. I'm going to get all
three of them back right now.

17
00:01:00,050 --> 00:01:02,100
Whoever did this won't get away with it.

18
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:04,540
No matter how far they run,
I will make them pay.

19
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:05,870
Obsession

20
00:01:08,290 --> 00:01:10,750
Kill

21
00:01:08,290 --> 00:01:10,750
Is there a point to setting the place on fire?

22
00:01:11,010 --> 00:01:14,010
Makes it obvious that it's been dealt with.

23
00:01:16,470 --> 00:01:17,130
What was that?

24
00:01:17,130 --> 00:01:17,860
A meteor?

25
00:01:17,860 --> 00:01:19,760
Who the hell is that?

26
00:01:26,530 --> 00:01:29,390
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

27
00:01:29,390 --> 00:01:32,200
(Get ready, dig your anger up, MOB!)

28
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:35,050
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

29
00:01:35,050 --> 00:01:36,110
(Get ready!)

30
00:01:37,010 --> 00:01:41,700
Coming down, could you fill your satisfaction?

31
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:47,440
You're a MOB. Can't you feel your own frustration?

32
00:01:48,470 --> 00:01:53,190
Coming down, could you fill your satisfaction?

33
00:01:54,210 --> 00:01:57,750
You're a MOB. What do you want to be?

34
00:01:57,750 --> 00:02:04,290
Wear your overflowing emotions on your sleeve and break it down.

35
00:02:05,510 --> 00:02:09,190
What do you see once you go beyond your limits?

36
00:02:09,190 --> 00:02:12,170
(99.9! 99.9!)

37
00:02:12,170 --> 00:02:15,050
The mysterious percentage.

38
00:02:16,730 --> 00:02:19,520
Cryin' my life, cryin' my psyche,

39
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:22,470
cryin' my heart in such commonplaces!

40
00:02:22,470 --> 00:02:25,300
Is that your ideal? Is that your mind?

41
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:28,210
It all begins when it hits 100.

42
00:02:28,210 --> 00:02:31,000
The MOB is alive. The MOB is high.

43
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:33,890
The MOB is staying frustrated, aren't you?

44
00:02:33,890 --> 00:02:38,280
Is that your ideal? Is that your mind? Right now...

45
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:40,820
Your life is your own.

46
00:02:40,820 --> 00:02:43,590
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

47
00:02:43,260 --> 00:02:48,100
Mob Psycho

48
00:02:43,590 --> 00:02:46,480
(Get ready, dig your anger up, MOB!)

49
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:49,350
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

50
00:02:49,350 --> 00:02:50,660
(Get ready!)

51
00:02:53,020 --> 00:02:58,030
Show Me What You've Got
~Band Together~

52
00:03:07,070 --> 00:03:10,120
You're Hanazawa Teruki... aren't you?

53
00:03:10,390 --> 00:03:13,380
Hanazawa? Oh, the guy that lives downsta—

54
00:03:13,380 --> 00:03:14,590
Telekinetic Explosion!

55
00:03:20,640 --> 00:03:22,050
I know you.

56
00:03:22,050 --> 00:03:25,280
You're our target.

57
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:28,310
How the hell did you find out about us?

58
00:03:28,510 --> 00:03:31,230
Well, whatever. You can die here.

59
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:37,780
Wow, looks like you're somewhat resilient.

60
00:03:41,530 --> 00:03:43,530
Where'd you take my family?

61
00:03:43,530 --> 00:03:45,190
This is great.

62
00:03:45,190 --> 00:03:49,500
Let's see if you die from
electrocution first or I just bite it!

63
00:03:49,690 --> 00:03:53,120
I'm not interested.
Use something other than electricity.

64
00:03:55,530 --> 00:03:57,750
Wait, is that all you can do?

65
00:03:57,750 --> 00:03:59,130
You're free to go.

66
00:04:03,090 --> 00:04:06,390
Maybe you're the guy, then.

67
00:04:06,390 --> 00:04:08,140
Show me your powers!

68
00:04:09,270 --> 00:04:11,170
You've got a lousy attitude, kid.

69
00:04:11,170 --> 00:04:16,110
If you want to see my powers
so badly, I'll show you!

70
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:22,030
They're fighting! Some old guy
and a middle school kid!

71
00:04:22,030 --> 00:04:25,310
I have impregnable armor
made out of energy.

72
00:04:25,750 --> 00:04:29,580
And I beat the crap out of my enemies.
That's my style.

73
00:04:30,460 --> 00:04:31,660
Seriously...

74
00:04:32,190 --> 00:04:34,540
Could you guys quit wasting my time?

75
00:04:34,540 --> 00:04:37,100
Looks like you have a decent barrier.

76
00:04:37,100 --> 00:04:39,250
Is that your power?!

77
00:04:40,750 --> 00:04:42,290
Quit messing with me!

78
00:04:45,390 --> 00:04:49,120
I want to see this power
that can create dummies!

79
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:51,100
Why did you attack my house?!

80
00:04:51,100 --> 00:04:52,810
Someone call an ambulance and the police!

81
00:04:52,810 --> 00:04:55,660
You've got the wrong idea...

82
00:04:55,660 --> 00:05:00,610
We were on our way
to attack your house...

83
00:05:01,230 --> 00:05:02,030
What?

84
00:05:02,490 --> 00:05:05,270
Hey! Who said you could pass out?!

85
00:05:05,270 --> 00:05:05,990
Hey!

86
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,200
Damn it...

87
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:11,630
I've contacted the upper echelon.

88
00:05:11,630 --> 00:05:16,630
Now you're totally screw... ed.

89
00:05:17,230 --> 00:05:21,430
This isn't good, Shigeo.
Seems there're more espers on the way.

90
00:05:21,430 --> 00:05:22,300
We need to—

91
00:05:22,300 --> 00:05:25,010
I haven't gotten any information yet, though.

92
00:05:25,530 --> 00:05:28,840
If they have more friends coming,
I'll just have to ask them.

93
00:05:31,700 --> 00:05:32,770
An umbrella?

94
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:40,830
Hey, you little shit. You in trouble?

95
00:05:43,140 --> 00:05:44,820
Chill with the murderous vibe back there.

96
00:05:45,030 --> 00:05:48,280
Former Claw
7th Division Member
Koyama

97
00:05:45,130 --> 00:05:47,970
We're not trying to start
any trouble with you.

98
00:05:48,540 --> 00:05:49,280
Right?

99
00:05:49,490 --> 00:05:52,450
Former Claw
7th Division Member

100
00:05:49,490 --> 00:05:52,450
Sakurai

101
00:05:49,580 --> 00:05:52,580
If you have any questions,
I'll answer them for you, kid.

102
00:05:52,830 --> 00:05:56,040
My family's wherever
you're taking me, aren't they?

103
00:05:56,190 --> 00:05:58,620
Your family? No, they aren't.

104
00:06:00,460 --> 00:06:03,000
Then I have no reason to go. Let me out.

105
00:06:03,180 --> 00:06:06,510
Hang on! Your friends and master
are waiting there!

106
00:06:06,510 --> 00:06:07,880
Reigen's there?

107
00:06:07,880 --> 00:06:10,210
In that case, we need to hurry!

108
00:06:10,210 --> 00:06:11,800
Yo, yo, wait, wait!

109
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:13,510
Don't be crazy!

110
00:06:20,530 --> 00:06:22,160
Ugh, I'm going to throw up...

111
00:06:22,710 --> 00:06:24,900
But we managed to shake anyone
who was tailing us.

112
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:27,700
We brought him.

113
00:06:27,700 --> 00:06:29,260
Here's Kageyama Shigeo.

114
00:06:29,660 --> 00:06:31,810
Long time no see, kid.

115
00:06:32,300 --> 00:06:34,620
You haven't let yourself go, have you?

116
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:38,500
I know we used to be rivals,
but I look forward to working with you...

117
00:06:38,940 --> 00:06:41,330
What the hell kind of gathering is this?

118
00:06:42,410 --> 00:06:44,090
Mob, are you all right?

119
00:06:44,500 --> 00:06:45,580
Master...

120
00:06:46,110 --> 00:06:49,050
My home... My family...

121
00:06:49,310 --> 00:06:51,010
Go on, but have a seat.

122
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:54,720
I'll actually explain everything
in Shigeo's place.

123
00:06:55,220 --> 00:06:57,560
Currently explaining the situation

124
00:06:57,690 --> 00:06:58,860
I see.

125
00:06:59,420 --> 00:07:01,560
Dimple, I need to talk to you for a sec.

126
00:07:01,740 --> 00:07:02,490
Sure.

127
00:07:04,260 --> 00:07:07,100
Did you just panic and lie
about the dummies?

128
00:07:07,100 --> 00:07:09,850
Kinda, but I do have reasons to believe it.

129
00:07:09,850 --> 00:07:12,380
You must've really been panicking.

130
00:07:12,380 --> 00:07:15,270
If Mob finds out you lied,
he's going to hate you forever.

131
00:07:17,100 --> 00:07:18,950
Mob, I need to talk to you.

132
00:07:19,630 --> 00:07:21,820
Are you going to tell him? Hang on a sec!

133
00:07:21,820 --> 00:07:23,500
If he learns the truth...

134
00:07:24,220 --> 00:07:26,680
Mob, your family...

135
00:07:28,510 --> 00:07:30,670
I think they're safe, too.

136
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:35,410
Those guys were still on the way
to your house, right?

137
00:07:35,410 --> 00:07:38,970
Someone must've known what
was going on and saved them.

138
00:07:39,540 --> 00:07:41,400
They started the fire
and made them look dead

139
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:43,500
so they wouldn't be targeted anymore.

140
00:07:44,170 --> 00:07:45,140
Isn't that great?

141
00:07:53,960 --> 00:07:56,460
The moment he relaxed, he fell fast asleep.

142
00:07:57,230 --> 00:07:59,410
Now it's your turn to talk.

143
00:08:00,130 --> 00:08:02,830
What the hell brought you lot together?

144
00:08:02,830 --> 00:08:04,380
Aren't these guys from Claw?!

145
00:08:04,380 --> 00:08:08,090
Former Claw
7th Division Member
Tsuchiya

146
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:08,500
Us members of the 7th Division left Claw.

147
00:08:08,980 --> 00:08:11,720
After being annihilated
by a group of middle school kids,

148
00:08:10,090 --> 00:08:13,800
Former Claw
7th Division Member
Mukai

149
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:14,090
we realized just how foolish we were.

150
00:08:14,090 --> 00:08:17,850
Mole

151
00:08:14,220 --> 00:08:17,850
Former Claw 7th Division Member
Muraki

152
00:08:14,310 --> 00:08:18,700
And now, we're all trying to start a new life.

153
00:08:19,210 --> 00:08:21,010
Following Master Reigen's example,

154
00:08:21,010 --> 00:08:24,440
we're trying to find a way to use
our powers for the good of society.

155
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:27,860
But the organization doesn't let traitors go.

156
00:08:28,060 --> 00:08:30,980
We figured they'd come after us
sooner rather than later,

157
00:08:30,980 --> 00:08:33,070
but this was a lot faster
than we anticipated.

158
00:08:33,070 --> 00:08:36,240
Former Claw
7th Division Member
Terada

159
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:36,780
And they launched attacks on all of us
at the same time.

160
00:08:37,220 --> 00:08:38,660
I'm impressed you survived that.

161
00:08:38,830 --> 00:08:42,570
Who do you think we are?
We're former Scars.

162
00:08:42,570 --> 00:08:44,030
Right, Tsucchi?

163
00:08:44,030 --> 00:08:48,380
Yeah. But the real battle will begin
after the guys from HQ show up.

164
00:08:48,550 --> 00:08:50,500
And then, we realized that

165
00:08:50,500 --> 00:08:54,590
we're going to need a leader
if we want to stand a chance against HQ.

166
00:08:54,590 --> 00:08:58,550
And so, they came to me.

167
00:08:58,550 --> 00:09:00,310
You should probably shut up for a bit.

168
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:03,940
When we saw Master Reigen put
the TV and media people in their place,

169
00:09:03,940 --> 00:09:05,890
we thought he was a genius.

170
00:09:06,090 --> 00:09:10,610
He's able to see the bigger picture
and make things happen.

171
00:09:11,020 --> 00:09:14,070
I seriously don't know about these guys...

172
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:16,780
You didn't get attacked?

173
00:09:17,170 --> 00:09:18,870
My office was destroyed.

174
00:09:19,470 --> 00:09:23,250
I just happened to be away
when it happened, thankfully.

175
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:26,380
Since I gained popularity
from my TV appearances,

176
00:09:26,380 --> 00:09:28,160
I thought I could get some renovations done.

177
00:09:28,920 --> 00:09:30,920
That's my office.

178
00:09:30,920 --> 00:09:33,920
Spirits and Such Consultation Office

179
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:33,920
It's on fire...

180
00:09:34,900 --> 00:09:37,630
But that's going to have to wait.

181
00:09:37,950 --> 00:09:41,260
After that, these guys picked me up.

182
00:09:41,260 --> 00:09:43,530
I was already exhausted from the marathon.

183
00:09:43,530 --> 00:09:45,390
Talk about a crappy day.

184
00:09:46,110 --> 00:09:48,600
I wonder if Teru-san's okay.

185
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:52,110
Oh, I got a message from him earlier.
He said he's fine.

186
00:09:52,110 --> 00:09:55,070
They exchanged emails

187
00:09:52,290 --> 00:09:53,560
When'd that happen?

188
00:09:53,560 --> 00:09:55,070
This sucks...

189
00:09:55,580 --> 00:09:57,280
What are you guys doing here?

190
00:09:57,480 --> 00:10:01,270
We're trying to lay low after what
happened with the 7th Division.

191
00:10:01,270 --> 00:10:04,200
Mitsuura-san prepared this hideout for us.

192
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:09,020
So many espers in one spot! I'm so moved!

193
00:10:09,420 --> 00:10:10,300
Oh, him.

194
00:10:12,540 --> 00:10:13,840
Teru-san!

195
00:10:14,550 --> 00:10:17,290
Heya. Looks like the gang's all here.

196
00:10:19,190 --> 00:10:19,970
You fools!

197
00:10:20,330 --> 00:10:24,130
You'll never get a word out of me!

198
00:10:24,380 --> 00:10:25,560
I'm a member of Cla—

199
00:10:27,610 --> 00:10:31,900
Resistance is futile.
No one's been able to endure this torture.

200
00:10:33,410 --> 00:10:35,440
Sorry! I'll talk!

201
00:10:35,740 --> 00:10:39,440
The boss was going around the world
to scout powerful espers,

202
00:10:39,440 --> 00:10:42,410
and he said he finally had
all the soldiers he needed!

203
00:10:42,890 --> 00:10:47,160
I see... Espers from around the world, eh?

204
00:10:47,590 --> 00:10:52,470
Don't tell me you fools still plan
to face us after hearing that...

205
00:10:53,690 --> 00:10:56,340
What shall we do, Master Reigen?

206
00:10:57,950 --> 00:11:00,200
Well, we can't just let this slide.

207
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:02,960
Let's report them to the police.

208
00:11:12,830 --> 00:11:14,270
Isn't it amazing?

209
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:18,190
Claw Foreigner Squad
Joseph

210
00:11:15,080 --> 00:11:18,490
Ordinary humans actually made all of this.

211
00:11:18,640 --> 00:11:22,170
I'm so excited.
I can't wait to destroy it all.

212
00:11:18,740 --> 00:11:22,410
Claw Foreigner Squad

213
00:11:18,740 --> 00:11:22,410
Udo

214
00:11:22,170 --> 00:11:24,830
That's why we came to this country, right?

215
00:11:24,830 --> 00:11:26,130
Really?

216
00:11:26,660 --> 00:11:28,230
I came here for the money.

217
00:11:36,130 --> 00:11:37,590
Mob Psycho

218
00:11:38,510 --> 00:11:39,500
Ladies and gentlemen,

219
00:11:40,090 --> 00:11:43,680
Claw

220
00:11:40,520 --> 00:11:43,680
I thank you all for gathering
on this memorable day.

221
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:47,820
I am the leader of Claw,
Suzuki Toichiro.

222
00:11:45,180 --> 00:11:48,140
Claw Boss
Suzuki Toichiro (46)

223
00:11:48,530 --> 00:11:53,350
Let's not waste any time.
We are about to declare war on the world.

224
00:11:53,950 --> 00:11:58,450
After twenty years, I finally have
the funds and manpower that I need.

225
00:11:58,780 --> 00:12:01,420
We will begin this revolution
with destruction.

226
00:11:58,780 --> 00:12:01,990
Claw

227
00:12:01,810 --> 00:12:05,320
We will destroy everything
that people built and hold dear.

228
00:12:05,870 --> 00:12:10,280
Let us show the powerless that we exist!

229
00:12:10,280 --> 00:12:12,000
Yeah!

230
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:15,540
World domination, eh?
Well, isn't that ambitious?

231
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:17,560
Are all the preparations complete?

232
00:12:17,560 --> 00:12:19,760
Oh, I don't even need to prepare.

233
00:12:19,760 --> 00:12:22,300
Claw

234
00:12:22,660 --> 00:12:23,790
What are they doing?

235
00:12:23,790 --> 00:12:24,720
Is that TV?

236
00:12:29,520 --> 00:12:31,890
Now you're live on all channels.

237
00:12:32,020 --> 00:12:37,610
Ultimate 5
Hatori

238
00:12:32,490 --> 00:12:35,390
The ability to infiltrate and
control any kind of system

239
00:12:35,390 --> 00:12:38,460
dealing with electronic devices or waves.

240
00:12:38,460 --> 00:12:41,400
He doesn't actually understand
how it works, either.

241
00:12:41,640 --> 00:12:43,990
He's good...

242
00:12:43,990 --> 00:12:48,000
We are esper organization Claw.

243
00:12:48,410 --> 00:12:51,420
We have taken over the airwaves
with our psychic powers.

244
00:12:51,420 --> 00:12:55,330
This is a mere fraction of our true power.

245
00:12:55,800 --> 00:12:59,170
Our powers are far superior
to modern weaponry.

246
00:12:59,460 --> 00:13:02,670
Let me warn you that
it's not advisable to oppose us.

247
00:13:03,090 --> 00:13:05,930
We will control the world with psychic powers

248
00:13:05,930 --> 00:13:06,010
Another esper?
Too many espers lolololol

249
00:13:05,930 --> 00:13:06,010
He's cray

250
00:13:05,930 --> 00:13:09,640
and rule over all of the powerless.

251
00:13:06,010 --> 00:13:06,550
What the hell is "Claw"?

252
00:13:06,010 --> 00:13:06,550
Claw lolololol Edgy much? Lololololol

253
00:13:06,550 --> 00:13:06,890
Apparently his brain stopped developing when he was a kid

254
00:13:06,550 --> 00:13:06,890
Okay, well I'm gonna be a superhero then

255
00:13:06,890 --> 00:13:07,470
Talk about lame

256
00:13:06,890 --> 00:13:07,470
This shit again? So boring

257
00:13:07,470 --> 00:13:07,890
I could probably take him in one punch

258
00:13:07,470 --> 00:13:07,890
You may be a claw, but I'm just a toenail

259
00:13:07,890 --> 00:13:09,640
Maki Maki
Oh, shit.
It's the end of the world lolololol
Yukki
