Well done.

369
00:18:15,460 --> 00:18:19,370
I knew it'd be a waste to let you
continue being a shut-in.

370
00:18:19,620 --> 00:18:23,950
Ultimate 5
Serizawa

371
00:18:19,630 --> 00:18:23,950
Yes, sir! It's all thanks to you that
I was able to step back into society!

372
00:18:23,950 --> 00:18:27,410
By the way, where's Shimazaki?
I haven't seen him.

373
00:18:28,080 --> 00:18:31,110
