I sure hope we end up on breaking news.

404
00:19:49,740 --> 00:19:52,280
Stop! Don't move!

405
00:19:52,600 --> 00:19:53,330
Does he have a gun?

406
00:19:53,330 --> 00:19:54,290
Freeze!

407
