453
00:23:29,720 --> 00:23:35,220
If I let it wither, it'd be over just like that

454
00:23:35,220 --> 00:23:40,510
But my hope just doesn't fade away

455
00:23:55,720 --> 00:23:58,250
The main force of Claw,
the Ultimate 5, terrorize Seasoning City.

456
00:23:58,250 --> 00:24:01,210
Meanwhile, the esper squad and
the boss's son, Sho, make their moves.

457
00:24:01,210 --> 00:24:02,920
Mob, this is no time to be sleeping!

